<title>MEXICO: Mexico sugar output, consumption data outlined.</title>
<headline>Mexico sugar output, consumption data outlined.</headline>
<dateline>CANCUN, Mexico 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican sugar industrialist Jose Pinto Mazal outlined here Wednesday output and consumption figures for Mexico for the last two years and gave estimates for 1997.</p>
<p>Pinto spoke at the F.O. Licht World Sugar and Sweetners' Conference here on southeastern Mexico. Figures are in million of tonnes. * Denote estimates from the National Sugar Chamber.</p>
<p>		   1995	   1996	   1997*</p>
<p>  Output	 4.22	   4.51	   4.45</p>
<p>  Consumption  4.04	   3.94	   4.04</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530))</p>
</text>
